{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "550613ba-6863-52fd-81eb-9e687798e482",
    "name": "BoaVoz API v1",
    "description": "Requisições da API pública do BoaVoz (C pública), com testes automáticos.\n\n**Antes de começar:** importe também o ambiente `BoaVoz dev`, selecione-o no canto superior direito e preencha `api_key`, `vercel_bypass`, `bot_id` e `phone`.\n\n- A autenticação (Bearer) e o cabeçalho da proteção da Vercel saem do ambiente, em todas as requisições.\n- As listagens guardam os ids no ambiente: rode \"Listar conversas\" primeiro.\n- Erros vêm no formato `{\"error\": {\"code\", \"message\", \"details\"}}` e aparecem no Console do Postman.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// proteção da Vercel: só o dev.boavoz.com pede (fica vazio em produção)",
          "const bypass = pm.environment.get(\"vercel_bypass\");",
          "if (bypass) pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: \"x-vercel-protection-bypass\", value: bypass });"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// erro da API: código, mensagem e detalhes no Console do Postman",
          "if (pm.response.code >= 400) {",
          "  try {",
          "    const e = pm.response.json().error;",
          "    console.log(pm.info.requestName, pm.response.code, e.code, e.message, JSON.stringify(e.details || {}));",
          "  } catch (_) {}",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Conversas",
      "description": "Leitura das conversas e do histórico (permissão **conversations**). A listagem guarda no ambiente o id da conversa mais recente de cada canal (`whatsapp_conversation_id`, `instagram_conversation_id`, `widget_conversation_id`), o contato delas e o `conversation_id` usado nas pausas (o do WhatsApp, quando há).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar conversas (guarda os ids)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/conversations?limit=20",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "conversations"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "channel",
                  "value": "whatsapp",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "ai_paused",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "since",
                  "value": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "contact",
                  "value": "phone:{{phone}}",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "bot_id",
                  "value": "{{bot_id}}",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mais recente primeiro. Filtros (ligue na aba Params): `channel` (widget, whatsapp, instagram), `status` (ai, ai_paused, waiting_human, human), `since`, `contact` e `bot_id`. Paginação por `next_cursor`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = body.data || [];",
                  "for (const ch of [\"whatsapp\", \"instagram\", \"widget\"]) {",
                  "  const c = data.find((x) => x.channel === ch);",
                  "  if (!c) continue;",
                  "  pm.environment.set(ch + \"_conversation_id\", c.id);",
                  "  if (c.contact) pm.environment.set(ch + \"_contact\", c.contact.id);",
                  "}",
                  "const main = data.find((x) => x.channel === \"whatsapp\") || data[0];",
                  "if (main) pm.environment.set(\"conversation_id\", main.id);",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"next_cursor\", body.next_cursor || \"\");",
                  "console.log(\"conversas:\", data.map((c) => `${c.channel} ${c.status} ${c.id}`).join(\"\\n\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Próxima página",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/conversations?limit=20&cursor={{next_cursor}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "conversations"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "{{next_cursor}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usa o `next_cursor` da listagem anterior."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"next_cursor\", pm.response.json().next_cursor || \"\");"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Só as pausadas pela integração",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/conversations?status=ai_paused",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "conversations"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "ai_paused"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Histórico da conversa",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "conversations",
                "{{conversation_id}}",
                "messages"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                },
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Da mais antiga para a mais nova, com status (received, sent, delivered, read, failed, uncertain) e error. Guarda o id da última mensagem em `message_id`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "if (data.length) pm.environment.set(\"message_id\", data[data.length - 1].id);",
                  "console.log(data.map((m) => `${m.direction} ${m.source} ${m.status}: ${(m.text || \"\").slice(0, 60)}`).join(\"\\n\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Uma mensagem",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/messages/{{message_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "messages",
                "{{message_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Permissão **messages**. O status também chega por webhook (message.status) e no histórico."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Pausa da IA",
      "description": "A integração pausa a IA numa conversa (sem avisar a equipe). Toda pausa tem prazo: sem `minutes`, 24 horas renovadas a cada mensagem enviada pela API; com `minutes`, de 1 a 10.080. Usa `{{conversation_id}}` (rode a listagem antes).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pausar por 10 minutos",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "description": "Uma chave nova a cada envio (o Postman gera). Repetir a mesma chave devolve a mesma resposta."
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/pause",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "conversations",
                "{{conversation_id}}",
                "pause"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"minutes\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"tem ai_paused_until\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ai_paused_until).to.be.a(\"string\"));"
